OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fovernight with clear spells for many.
OL,7,FJust a very small chance of the odd
OL,8,Fshower moving into the northwest of
OL,9,Fthe region. A fresher and more
OL,10,Fcomfortable night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FRemaining largely dry with
OL,13,Fspells of sunshine, although the
OL,14,Fsunshine maybe rather hazy at times.
OL,15,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,16,FAugust.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
